#: src/Internal/Admin/OrderTaxLookupMigrator.php:290
msgid "This will rebuild the Analytics tax data of orders recorded before WooCommerce kept a record of every tax line. The rebuild happens over time in the background (via Action Scheduler). There is currently %s order to rebuild."
